      "body": {
        "mommy_and_me_html": "<p>Shop our {{ title }} for birthdays, family photos, vacations, and easy everyday twinning, with dresses, swimsuits, and matching sets all in one place.</p><p>Start with dresses for portraits and special occasions, move into swimsuits for beach and pool days, and use the broader outfit mix to build a matching wardrobe that works across seasons instead of only one event.</p>",
        "spring_matching_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} with pastel palettes, spring florals, and occasion-ready looks built for church, brunch, egg hunts, family photos, and other seasonal celebrations.</p><p>These styles are designed for shoppers who already know the moment they are dressing for and want matching outfits that feel polished, comfortable, and easy to wear again through the rest of spring.</p>",
        "dresses_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for family photos, celebrations, and polished everyday moments. This edit keeps the strongest dress styles together in one place, with coordinated looks that feel pretty, wearable, and easy to shop.</p>",
        "maxi_dresses_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for flowing matching styles that feel graceful, easy to wear, and ready for photos, travel, celebrations, and polished everyday moments.</p>",
        "swimsuits_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for beach trips, pool days, cruises, and sunny family photos. This collection helps shoppers compare matching family swimsuits, mom and daughter matching swimsuits, and family matching bathing suits without jumping between separate swim categories.</p><p>Use this page as the broad swim hub first, then branch into the dedicated family swim collection or matching trunks when the whole family needs to coordinate around one print or color story.</p>",
        "family_swimsuits_html": "<p>Discover {{ title }} for beach vacations, pool days, cruises, and summer photos. This is the clearest landing page for matching family bathing suits when moms, dads, girls, and boys all need to coordinate around one print, palette, or vacation-ready color story.</p><p>Use this page when the whole family wants matching swimwear first, then round out the look with trunks, cover-ups, and related mommy-and-me swim options for a fuller trip wardrobe.</p>",
        "family_sets_html": "<p>Explore {{ title }} with coordinated looks designed for family vacations, beach trips, cruises, travel photos, and warm-weather outings. These sets help you create a clear family palette without forcing every person into the exact same piece.</p><p>Use this page for matching family vacation outfits and matching family beach outfits, then branch into broader family matching collections when you need more seasonal or non-travel-specific options.</p>",
        "new_women_outfits_html": "<p>Explore {{ title }} as the broad Family Matching Outfits hub when you want to compare coordinated outfits before narrowing into a specific category. This page is meant to help shoppers move from a general browse into dresses, swimwear, vacation sets, mommy and me looks, or other matching styles without starting over.</p><p>Use the links below to jump into the collections that best fit the occasion, whether you are shopping for family photos, a trip, a seasonal refresh, or a more specific matching outfit style.</p>",
        "family_matching_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for family photos, travel, birthdays, holidays, and easy everyday twinning. It is the best place to start when you want to compare coordinated looks across the family before narrowing into dresses, swimwear, or vacation sets.</p>",
        "daddy_me_html": "<p>Explore {{ title }} for family photos, vacations, Father's Day gifts, and everyday coordination. This landing page is built around the strongest daddy-and-kid search intent, with matching tees, casual tops, and dressier shirt options all in one place.</p><p>Use this collection when you want broad coverage across daddy and me shirts, tees, and outfits, then narrow into button-up, Hawaiian, or t-shirt styles based on the occasion.</p>",
        "daddy_me_tshirts_html": "<p>Shop {{ title }} when you want casual, giftable matching tops for dads and kids. This page is built around daddy and me shirts, matching tees, and easy everyday looks that work for Father's Day, birthdays, family trips, and quick photo moments.</p><p>Start here for slogan tees and easy graphic styles, then move into dress shirts or Hawaiian sets if the occasion calls for a sharper look or a more vacation-ready outfit.</p>",
        "daddy_me_shirts_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for shoppers looking specifically for button-up, dress shirt, and Hawaiian-style father-son outfits. This collection focuses on collared looks that work for portraits, dinners, beach trips, weddings, and other polished occasions.</p><p>Compared with casual tees, these styles lean more structured and photo-ready, making them a stronger fit when you want matching outfits that still look elevated.</p>",
        "couples_html": "<p>Explore {{ title }} for date nights, vacations, holiday gifting, engagement photos, and everyday coordination. This page is designed for shoppers who want more than one matching top and need a broader starting point for coordinated looks.</p><p>Start with easy tees or lounge sets, then build a more complete outfit around the trip, occasion, or photo moment you are shopping for.</p>",
        "couples_tshirts_html": "<p>Browse {{ title }} for shoppers searching couples matching shirts, couple t shirts, and everyday coordinated tops. These styles work best when you want a casual, giftable look for trips, holidays, concerts, date nights, and photos.</p><p>Use this page for easy everyday matching, then step up to the broader couples collection if you want a fuller outfit built around more than tees alone.</p>"
      },
